### Stock (E4-02). Local server: cd server && npm run dev
# Needs the seed: cd server && npx sequelize db:seed:all
# Log in first (http/auth.http); the token of the Owner goes into @token below.
@token = paste-the-token-here
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# IDs from the list answers (GET /api/warehouses and GET /api/products):
@warehouseId = paste-a-warehouse-id-here
@productId = paste-a-product-id-here
# A new UUID each time you want a new receipt. Sending the SAME one again is a replay.
@key = 7b0d6a54-1f0e-4a39-9a1c-5d2f8c3e4b10

### Receive stock (Owner, or Warehouse Admin of an assigned warehouse)
# Expect 201 { id, warehouseId, productId, quantity, createdAt } (the movement, not the balance).
# Send it again with the same Idempotency-Key: the same 201 body plus the header Idempotency-Replayed: true,
# and no second movement.
# 400 VALIDATION_ERROR: no or malformed Idempotency-Key, quantity outside 1..1000000, note over 255 characters, unknown field.
# 403 FORBIDDEN: a Viewer, or a warehouse that is unassigned, archived, foreign or missing (one body).
# 404 NOT_FOUND: a product that is foreign or missing. 409 CONFLICT: an archived product, or the stock would pass 2147483647.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "warehouseId": "{{warehouseId}}", "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 25, "note": "PO-2026-001" }

### Missing Idempotency-Key
# Expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR with details [{ "source": "header", "path": "Idempotency-Key", "message": "Wajib diisi." }]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "warehouseId": "{{warehouseId}}", "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 1 }
